content:
Na Yesaia de akokoɔduru ka sɛ,
  “Wɔn a wɔnhwehwɛ me no hunuu me;
    medaa me ho adi kyerɛɛ wɔn a wɔmmisaa mʼase no.”

na wama amanamanmufoɔ nso akamfo no wɔ ne mmɔborɔhunu ho, sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ,
  “Yei enti, mɛkamfo wo wɔ amanamanmufoɔ mu;
    na mato nnwom akamfo wo din.”

Na bio,
  “Amanamanmufoɔ nyinaa nyi Awurade ayɛ;
    asase so aman nyinaa monkamfo no.”

“Wɔn anom te sɛ damena a abue;
    na wɔn tɛkrɛma ka atorɔsɛm.”
  “Wɔn anofafa ka nsɛm a ɛte sɛ ɔwɔ ano borɔ.”

Dabi! Wɔatwerɛ sɛ,
  “Wo enti, wɔkum yɛn daa nyinaa;
    wɔbu yɛn sɛ nnwan a wɔrekɔkum wɔn.”
